SquelchASR

The Qwen3-ASR model code in Sources/SquelchASR (Qwen3*.swift, MetalBudget.swift)
is adapted from speech-swift (formerly ivan-digital/qwen3-asr-swift):

  https://github.com/soniqo/speech-swift
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Files carry an "Adapted from" header naming the upstream file. Changes were made
for use in Voco, AISubtitle and Squelch (adapter loading, warmup, chunking at
silence, segmenter). Distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
